        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/4406840113563-Understanding-Australia-s-anti-spam-legislation#h_01JVM9JQCRE8T1BBR9X2NE1NHF",
          "text": "You will learn"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/4406840113563-Understanding-Australia-s-anti-spam-legislation#h_01JVM9JQCRC5AVCX32ETPPM5DF",
          "text": "About Australia’s Spam Act and regulations"
